ind":"update","title":"Legend of Azure Peak : Wuxia Heroes - DEMO 1.8 Update Notes","summary":"Legend of Azure Peak : Wuxia Heroes - DEMO 1.8 Update Notes Adjusted Ao Bing's base stats as some players were consistently getting stuck at this encounter.Reduced the enhancement stone requirement for equipment upgrades from 5 to 3.Increased the success rate of equipment dismantling, making it easier to obtain enhancement stones.Increased the equipment drop rates for elite monsters.Reduced the cost of upgrading lower-tier enhancement stones to higher-tier ones from 5 to 3.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T04:20:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067935355","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:47:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4832420-1844751498227480","game_id":"steam-4832420","kind":"update","title":"Legend of Azure Peak: Wuxia Heroes — DEMO v1.7 Update","summary":"Hi everyone! Thanks so much for all your incredible feedback and support during our Demo launch! Based on your recent suggestions, we’ve just released Demo v1.7 with the following quality-of-life improvements and balancing tweaks: Camera Follow Toggle: Disabled automatic camera follow to reduce motion sickness/3D dizziness.Cutscene Playback Speed: Press the \\ during story cutscenes to open a Playback Speed menu (Normal Speed, 2x, 3x) so you can enjoy the narrative at your preferred pace.Random B","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-26T15:59:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498227480","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:47:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4832420-1844751498218219","game_id":"steam-4832420","kind":"announcement","title":"⚔️ Legend of Azure Peak Demo Unlocks Tomorrow! (Sept 24 PDT / Sept 25 CST)","summary":"Hi everyone!The wait is almost over! The free playable Demo for Legend of Azure Peak: Wuxia Heroes will officially be available tomorrow (Sept 24 at 10:00 AM PDT / Sept 25 at 01:00 AM CST)!What to expect in the Demo:Experience our turn-based tactical RPG combat system.Master character skills and tactical buff strategies.Explore early-game story chapters and challenging tactical battles!The full release will feature a massive 30–40+ hour adventure, but this demo is designed to give you a solid pr","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-23T11:59:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498218219","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:47:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4832420-1842846814446525","game_id":"steam-4832420","kind":"announcement","title":"Mark Your Calendars! Free Playable Demo Arriving September 24!","summary":"Greetings, Heroes!The wait is almost over. We are thrilled to announce that the official playable Demo for Legend of Azure Peak : Wuxia Heroes will officially be available on Steam!Prepare to step into a dark, intrigue-filled mid-Ming Dynasty, form your party, and test your tactical prowess against formidable foes.📅 Demo Release ScheduleUS West (PDT): September 24, 2026 @ 10:00 AMChina Standard Time (CST): September 25, 2026 @ 1:00 AMUTC: September 24, 2026 @ 5:00 PM⚔️ What to Expect in the Demo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-04T13:32:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814446525","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:47:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4832420-1835236783566963","game_id":"steam-4832420","kind":"announcement","title":"Sneak Peek at the Demo Menu: Which Path Will You Choose?","s